    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDetached four, or possibly five, bedroom home beautifully presented and located in an established and highly sought-after development in Newcastle, an area within walking distance to the city while also being well serviced locally with amenities and public transport. \n\nConstructed in the mid 1970's, number 19 Hazel Park is a four-bedroom residence with a possible 5th bedroom or home office on the ground floor. The property is ideally positioned within this mature residential development overlooking a small green area with a spacious and very private west facing garden to the rear. Ready for immediate use, it has been recently upgraded with new flooring, a new kitchen and improvements to the insulation. The accommodation is spacious and has a very good layout over 2 floors, featuring a large sitting room and very generous bedrooms. Externally, to the front low maintenance shrubbery borders a tarmac area providing private parking while to the rear the garden is a standout feature due to the aspect, finish and privacy.\n\nHazel Park is a mature, well-regarded development with excellent services such as schools, sports clubs and bus services within easy reach while it is also close to the University of Galway, University College Hospital Galway (UCHG) and to the IDA Galway Business Park."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nTiled floor, timber staircase.\n\nSitting Room: - \nLarge bright room with dual aspect, timber floor, open fire with marble fireplace.\n\nKitchen: - \nNewly installed kitchen with modern finish & quality, integrated oven, electric hob & microwave. Dishwasher, fridge & freezer also included. Rear aspect window & side door.\n\nStudy/Playroom: - \nCarpet flooring, dual aspect, potentially suitable as guest bedroom.\n\nShower Room: - \nFully tiled, WC, wash hand basin, electric shower, side aspect window.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nCarpet flooring, built in wardrobe, front aspect window.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nCarpet flooring, built in wardrobe, rear aspect window.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nCarpet flooring, built in wardrobe, rear aspect window.\n\nBedroom 4: - \nCarpet flooring, built in wardrobe, front aspect window.\n\nBathroom: - \nFully tiled, WC, wash hand basin, electric shower, rear aspect window.\n\nGarden: - \nThe rear garden is not overlooked and is a standout feature due to the west facing aspect, finish and privace. It includes generous block built garden shed serviced with plumbing and wiring. The front driveway is beautifully finished with low maintenance shrubbery bordering a tarmac area providing excellent private parking.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Popular location on bus route</li><li>Mature, established area</li><li>Large, private rear garden which is not overlooked</li><li>Westerly rear aspect</li><li>External walls pumped & insulated</li><li>Oil central heating</li><li>Rear storage shed</li><li>New kitchen</li><li>Beautifully presented</ul>"
      },
